+# TLS Certificate Verification Policy
+
+This project requires TLS certificate verification to be enforced across all build configurations, including development builds. An earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification specifically in development builds was reconsidered and reverted because it left a security gap in non-production environments; the current recorded decision eliminates that gap by requiring the same certificate validation in development, staging, and production alike.
